BT /F2 14 Tf 72.00 740.00 Td (Poem) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 150.00 700.00 Td (The river keeps its own slow hours) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 150.00 683.00 Td (and carries what the hills let go;) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 180.00 666.00 Td (a leaf, a feather, quiet flowers,) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 180.00 649.00 Td (the small blue sky it learned to show.) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 150.00 620.00 Td (We watched it from the bridge at noon) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 470.00 620.00 Td (5) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 150.00 603.00 Td (and counted ripples one by one,) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 180.00 586.00 Td (until the swallows came back soon) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 180.00 569.00 Td (and every count was lost in sun.) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 150.00 540.00 Td (So let the water have its way,) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 150.00 523.00 Td (and let the evening carry on;) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 470.00 523.00 Td (10) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 150.00 486.00 Td (Morning came early) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 310.00 486.00 Td (and left the same way) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 150.00 469.00 Td (Evening came late) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 310.00 469.00 Td (and stayed a while) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 150.00 452.00 Td (Night came softly) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 310.00 452.00 Td (and said nothing at all) Tj ET
endstream
endobj
